	(text "MCU (STM32L031G6U6, DocID027063 Rev 5)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b3ccfee-90af-5e36-93e1-c26f5b256766"))
	(text "UI and debug" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1e65488-a566-5475-b199-09c33dca30c8"))
	(text "Wake sources use distinct EXTI lines: RTC_INT PA0 (EXTI0, WKUP1), BTN2 PB1 (EXTI1),\nLID PA2 (EXTI2, WKUP3), BTN1 PA3 (EXTI3), NFC_GPO PA8 (EXTI8). Any EXTI line wakes Stop mode.\nLCD: SPI1 SCK PA5 / MOSI PA7 (AF0); SCS PA4 and DISP PA6 as GPIO. I2C1 PB6/PB7 (AF1).\nSpares (no-connect): PA9/PA10 (USART2 TX/RX for a debug UART), PA15, PB3, PC14, PC15.\nLid: CT8132 push-pull, low while the lid is shut; no pull-up, PA2 internal pull off.\nButtons: internal pull-ups off; 1M externals draw nothing while released.\nC14 (10 uF per ST) is DNP: its IR spec allows ~0.6 uA leakage on always-on VBAT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 101.6 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5ac7d1a9-ae8d-542f-8b6e-64c62de28e10"))
